WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540
You might have a form you already use in another app, or a Word

2
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.840
document, a PDF, a spreadsheet or even just a photo.

3
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.720
You can upload any of these, or just copy and paste the questions in.

4
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:14.520
If it's on another app, you can export your data from it, or simply

5
00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.450
upload a previously completed record.

6
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.540
Quickler will extract the questions for you.

7
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:23.740
You can then check it over, make any edits and press continue.

8
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:26.320
Your team can then use it on WhatsApp straight away.
